  note: spec § 13: an `extern` is checked against the real header. Declare exactly the parameters the header has, at its widths; a function it declares variadic (`...`) takes nothing a binding can type past it, so a header of your own defines a `static inline` function of a new name with a fixed prototype that calls it, and the group binds that
